{"availability":"available","full":"seehiong/local-ai-starter","name":"local-ai-starter","description":"🚀 Zero-backend, 100% client-side local AI assistant starter template. Powered by WebGPU and Google LiteRT-LM (Gemma 4). Offline-first PWA with multi-language TTS, customizable personas, and GitHub Pages deployment in 5 minutes.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"JavaScript","stars":63,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-18T07:04:24Z","updated":"2026-08-08T13:39:49Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://seehiong.github.io/local-ai-starter/","topics":["client-side-ai","gemma","github-pages","javascript","litert-lm","local-ai","offline-first","persona-starter","privacy-first","pwa","tts","web-llm","webgpu","zero-backend"],"demo":"https://seehiong.github.io/local-ai-starter/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T20:13:13.800Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-07T20:13:13.800Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-07T20:13:13.800Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T19:22:27.518Z","stars":63,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-07T20:13:13.800Z","stars":63,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A zero-backend, 100% client-side, and offline-first starter template for building and deploying your own browser-based AI assistant. Powered by WebGPU and Google LiteRT-LM, it runs open models directly on the client. Fork, customize, and deploy to GitHub Pages in 5 minutes!"],"features":["Zero-Backend (GitHub Pages Friendly): Fully serverless. Host it free on GitHub Pages, Cloudflare Pages, or Netlify with zero setup.","Config-Only Customization (config.json): Customize the app name, default model, color themes, logo SVG, language options, and quick-action prompt buttons in a single configuration file. No JavaScript coding required!","Modular Persona Library: Easily add or modify personas by editing JSON files in the personas/ directory (comes preloaded with Coding Helper, Travel Guide, Language Tutor, Interviewer, and Mat